# Normalize line endings on commit and checkout.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows and published from it. Without this,
# `git status` reports every file as modified after a clone because the working
# tree uses CRLF while the index has LF — noise that hides real changes. Measured
# on 2026-10-16: a fresh clone showed 0 modifications, but any editor that saved
# a file reintroduced CRLF and turned one edited line into a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must keep their exact bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
